{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-detail-template-js","path":"/blog/property-of-the-week-al-habtoor-polo-resort-and-club-villas/","result":{"data":{"strapiBlog":{"createdAt":"2025-03-06T06:23:21.350Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-09T16:21:53.053Z","video_url":null,"title":"Property of the Week: Al Habtoor Polo Resort & Club Villas ","short_description":"Let's talk about Dubai’s premier polo and equestrian community perfect for those who seek unparalleled luxury, absolute privacy, and a lifestyle defined by prestige.","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Property_of_the_Week_Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_a440a3b30e.jpg"},"team_contact":null,"strapi_id":415,"slug":"property-of-the-week-al-habtoor-polo-resort-and-club-villas","publish":true,"id":"df9c722b-5c89-5a5f-be7c-0b01cd716854","rank":null,"date":"March 06, 2025","category":{"strapi_json_value":["Luxury Insights"],"id":"ba839139-71fe-597c-8bf8-b6cbacb9a8e6"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Property_of_the_Week_Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_a440a3b30e.jpg"},"author":null,"modules":[{"id":"dafba96f-1e6c-5d4b-91d0-7ab17343af72","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":851,"text":{"data":{"text":"<p>Let's talk about Dubai’s premier polo and equestrian community perfect for those who seek unparalleled luxury, absolute privacy, and a lifestyle defined by prestige. Nestled in the heart of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand-residence-complex/\">DubaiLand</a>, Dubai’s Al Habtoor Polo Resort &amp; Club Villas spans over 6 million square feet. Discover what makes this first-of-its-kind gated enclave a rare gem, especially its ready-to-move-in villas, which redefine grandeur and elegance.</p><h2>A Prime Location in DubaiLand</h2><p>Strategically positioned along Emirates Road (E611), <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/al-habtoor-polo-resort-and-club-dubailand/\">Al Habtoor Polo Resort</a> is just 20 minutes from Downtown Dubai and 30 minutes from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Dubai International</a> Airport. Situated near The Villa and Falcon City, it provides a serene retreat while ensuring effortless connectivity to Dubai’s dynamic cityscape.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><strong>Five-Star Hotel</strong> delivering world-class hospitality</li><li><strong>Exclusive Polo Academy</strong> with internationally recognized tournaments</li><li><strong>Bentley &amp; Polo Shops</strong> for an elite shopping experience</li><li><strong>Gourmet Fine Dining</strong> for culinary indulgence</li><li><strong>Tennis &amp; Paddle Courts</strong> promoting an active lifestyle</li><li><strong>Expansive Villas</strong> designed for privacy and luxury</li></ul><h2>Luxury Villas at Habtoor Polo Resort</h2><p>Designed for discerning homeowners, this gated enclave is home to a five-star resort, world-class polo fields, and luxurious villas, presenting a prestigious investment opportunity tailored for high-net-worth individuals.</p><ul><li>3-Bedroom Twin Villas&nbsp;</li><li>4-Bedroom Twin Villas&nbsp;</li><li>4-Bedroom Stand-Alone Villas&nbsp;</li><li>5-Bedroom Villas&nbsp;</li><li>6-Bedroom Villas&nbsp;</li></ul><p>With generous plot sizes, every villa ensures an unparalleled level of privacy while maintaining seamless access to Dubai’s vibrant lifestyle.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Luxury_Villas_at_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_4b09cbdedc.jpg\" alt=\"Luxury Villas at Habtoor Polo Resort\"></p>"}}},{"id":"fe7a1bb3-6d48-59a4-93f7-3218d9334a68","strapi_id":431,"strapi_component":"modules.ads-banner","small":false,"marketing_banner":{"title":"Dubai's Trusted Property Managers","bg_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.jpg"},"icon":null,"cta":{"cta_label":" Get Started","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"c354e542-6074-53b4-83f7-a63b1f3c110b","strapi_id":1153,"menu":{"title":"Property Management","page":{"layout":"landing_page","id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78","publish":true,"page_name":"Property Management","strapi_id":69},"strapi_parent":{"slug":"property-services","title":"Services","publish":true,"link_type":"internal","id":31},"link_type":"internal","slug":"property-management","strapi_id":72,"id":"9d7f13f0-a330-59e7-91e2-8cf7aa21637a"}},"cta1":null,"description":{"data":{"description":"<p>Maximize returns with our efficient, expert property care.</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.webp","transform":"492x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.webp","transform":"1128x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1128x/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.jpg","transform":"1128x","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/492x/trusted_property_managers_4cc49e805e.jpg","transform":"492x","format":"jpg"}]}],"heading":"Your Property, Our Priority","publish":true,"rank":4,"strapi_id":11,"style":null}},{"id":"cc93a355-ffc9-517b-99b6-b0843af6404e","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":852,"text":{"data":{"text":"<h2>Al Habtoor Polo Resort &amp; Club Villas: A Strategic Investment Opportunity</h2><p>Managed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/\">Zoya Ventures Real Estate</a>, the sales strategy at Al Habtoor Polo Resort is transparent, providing investors with the flexibility to customize, enhance, and maximize their return on equity (ROE). Contact us to find out how Investors can unlock significant capital appreciation through strategic upgrades and conversions.</p><p><img src=\"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_A_Strategic_Investment_Opportunity_23816968b2.jpg\" alt=\"Al Habtoor Polo Resort &amp; Club Villas: A Strategic Investment Opportunity\"></p><h3>The Time to Invest is Now</h3><p>As Dubai’s real estate market experiences sustained growth, demand for villas and townhouses remains at an all-time high. With new project handovers not expected until <strong>2028</strong>, investors at Habtoor Polo Resort have a unique advantage—access to <strong>ready-to-move-in units at pre-appreciation prices.</strong></p><p>Secure your place in this ultra-exclusive community, where luxury is not just a feature but a defining lifestyle.</p>"}}}],"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.webp","transform":"376x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.webp","transform":"744x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1650x/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.webp","transform":"1650x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1260x/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.webp","transform":"1260x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/Al_Habtoor_Polo_Resort_and_Club_Villas_Dubai_Land_d28abaf801.webp","transform":"340x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1000x/